{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣第24屆同志遊行今天（31日）在台北舉行，蔡康永日前接受主持人王偉忠專訪，直言他是因台北市警方搜索同志酒吧決定出席政治活動。</p><p>不過蔡康永經紀人表示，蔡康永今天不會現身同志遊行，原因未進一步說明。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.197741+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T08:29:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:24.874129+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.062851+00:00","content_hash":"c8d606088ac9384db5ae07ee5ae1fec85261242d0edb1ccd9dab7fe80561b807","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}